Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.21,0:00:32.22,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Let's kick it up a notch, Itadori!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:33.58,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,This will be the last time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:36.48,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,you and I curse each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:41.88,Main,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.88,0:00:44.35,Main,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,Are you leaving me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:03.33,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,He severed it himself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:27.23,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Soul Multiplicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.14,0:01:34.08,Narration,Narrator,0000,0000,0000,,By combining souls with weak \Nrejection, it creates an amalgamation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:36.72,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Polymorphic Soul Isomer!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:39.44,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,What is that transfigured human?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.89,0:01:56.08,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,Given that he's able to \Nhold off me and my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:02:00.37,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,the distribution of power \Nbetween his bodies is likely 2 to 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.64,0:02:09.02,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,And the weakened 2 is the main body!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.02,0:02:12.57,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make certain my brother crushes it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:19.80,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,I've heard its transfigured humans \Nare around grade 3 or a weak grade 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:23.27,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,Crush it quickly, Aoi Todo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:27.37,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.37,0:02:28.44,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Todo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.03,0:02:31.89,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,That's for underestimating me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.50,0:03:02.25,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,It's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:07.16,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,It had so much power, \Nyet it only took a single blow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:13.18,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,Now I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.45,0:03:20.08,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,It managed to gain explosive power by \Nburning through multiple souls in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:22.77,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,It's an extremely offense-oriented \Ntransfigured human.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:24.36,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:27.32,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,there are two more?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:38.38,Main,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,Forgive me, you pitiful souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:54.08,Show_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,825)\pos(320,10)\3c&H8ECEDD&}JUJUTSU KAISEN\N{\fs16\bord0\fscy100\c&HDEDCE0&}Shibuya Incident
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:19.56,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I've finished getting us away \Nfrom the topknot gorilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:20.71,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Now to just
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.01,0:05:22.61,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.77,0:06:31.87,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Tsk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:40.20,Main,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,It would seem you're dead \Nset on leaving me out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.87,0:06:44.88,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I couldn't completely take him down \Nwith two Polymorphic Soul Isomers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.64,0:06:51.70,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Landing any blow on this guy \Nis a rather steep hurdle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.13,0:06:55.26,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,But if I unleash my domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:07:01.31,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I'll touch Sukuna and get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:04.63,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Barriers are complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:08.56,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I already revealed the option \Nof excluding him from my domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.56,0:07:11.82,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,The same ploy won't work on Itadori again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.82,0:07:14.23,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,So what do I do, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:17.12,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,The one who taught me that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:21.84,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Domain Expansion:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:25.89,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Self-Embodiment of Perfection!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:29.70,Main,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,I thought that was suicide for it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.21,0:07:32.16,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,It's a desperate gamble!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.16,0:07:35.22,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,On a 0.2-second domain expansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.73,0:07:41.51,Narration,Narration,0000,0000,0000,,Todo moved to protect himself \Nfrom the domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.51,0:07:44.90,Narration,Narration,0000,0000,0000,,activating the Simple Domain he \Nlearned directly from Yuki Tsukumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:51.20,Narration,Narration,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori acted even faster, \Nracing forth to exorcise Mahito
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:53.52,Narration,Narration,0000,0000,0000,,before he unleashed Idle Transfiguration.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:58.99,Narration,Narration,0000,0000,0000,,Though Mahito activated his \Ntechnique even faster than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.99,0:08:00.30,Narration,Narration,0000,0000,0000,,The manifestation of an innate domain
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:02.04,Narration,Narration,0000,0000,0000,,is usually followed by \Nthe activation of a technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:05.29,Narration,Narration,0000,0000,0000,,but he merged those two \Nseparate steps into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:09.40,Narration,Narration,0000,0000,0000,,It was an act of speed made possible by his \Nawakened state that followed Black Flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:16.51,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I take it I'm safe this time, Sukuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:22.85,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Knowing you, you have some kind of \Nbackup plan with Itadori, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.76,0:08:25.28,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.68,0:08:28.69,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I'll kill Itadori before \Nyou switch with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:31.03,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,So shut up and watch from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.05,0:08:53.44,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Todo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.81,0:09:02.77,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, I just made you more fashionable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.31,0:09:07.17,Narration,Narration,0000,0000,0000,,After deploying a domain, \Nthe technique engraved into the body
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.17,0:09:10.07,Narration,Narration,0000,0000,0000,,is temporarily burned out,\Nand using it proves challenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.07,0:09:15.36,Narration,Narration,0000,0000,0000,,Mahito already understood that after \Nhis flight from Satozakura High School.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:19.42,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Black Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:24.28,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,He just...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.28,0:09:28.37,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,focused all his damn cursed \Nenergy in his stomach on instinct!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:37.03,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,However, my technique has recovered!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.03,0:09:38.84,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,And he can't clap his hands anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:41.86,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,This time, I'll kill him for certain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:09:57.87,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:09:59.86,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.52,0:10:01.36,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:04.77,Main,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\an3\fnArial\fs16\bord1\shad0\blur2\pos(627,333)}Takada-chan - "Climax☆JUMPING!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:50.44,Sign_Basic,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\fnArial\fs16\bord1\shad0\blur2\pos(17,26)}*Todo's imagination
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.05,0:10:56.92,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:11:01.05,Italics,Itadori,0000,0000,0000,,Black Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:06.80,Main,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.80,0:11:09.20,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,It was just for a moment, but I touched him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:12.22,Italics,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,It's a miracle I got off with only this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:27.09,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Leave the rest to me, Todo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.49,0:11:30.20,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Todo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.01,0:11:33.18,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.18,0:11:36.50,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe I took another \NBlack Flash dead-on at that moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:40.00,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,That damn gorilla screwed \Nwith me until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.41,0:11:43.00,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,But now I've finally grasped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:48.01,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,The true essence of my soul! Its true shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.01,0:11:51.01,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Idle Transfiguration...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.96,0:12:06.49,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Instant Spirit Body of Distorted Killing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:09.94,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,It's a happy birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.55,0:12:12.00,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:17.97,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1350,0)\1c&H213835&\3c&H75EFED&\blur20\1a&HE0&\3a&HC0&\pos(320,18)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:17.97,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1350,0)\3c&HA0DCE8&\pos(320,18)\c&H292619&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:22.28,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't a transformation \Nas just a means, like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.68,0:12:25.26,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,What's different?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:28.44,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I understood after using Black Flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:32.48,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,What my true, unbridled soul is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:34.40,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.40,0:12:37.51,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't strike me as the type \Nto go on a journey of self-discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.63,0:12:40.05,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.54,0:12:43.48,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm just starting on the final touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.48,0:12:48.74,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,After I kill you, I'll finally \Nbe truly born into this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:30.51,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,So tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.51,0:13:31.87,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Its bare body
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:33.41,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,is even harder than {\i0}his{\i1} was!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.30,0:13:55.15,Flashback,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I understood after using Black Flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:59.05,Flashback,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,What my true, unbridled soul is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.35,0:14:01.40,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Is that what he meant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:23.80,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,This thing has already...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:25.85,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,become something on a different level
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.85,0:14:28.00,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,than the cursed spirit he was \Nprior to transforming?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.45,0:15:02.24,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,If I want to defeat this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.01,0:15:07.42,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have to hit him with a Black Flash
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:07.23,Sign_Basic,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\shad0\pos(320,16)}There is no sorcerer who can unleash a Black Flash at will
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.36,0:15:11.26,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,using my maximum cursed energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:30.05,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I only used it for \Na moment, getting hit with
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:32.76,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,a Black Flash right after my \Ndomain expansion was real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:49.25,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,We're both
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:53.08,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,still brimming with energy, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:20.80,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,There is no one who can unleash \Na Black Flash at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.16,0:16:26.42,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,But something about him convinces \Nme that the current Itadori can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.85,0:16:29.30,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,In which case...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.59,0:17:00.58,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,A time lag?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.25,0:17:13.84,Main,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, cursed spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:16.72,Main,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way you don't understand this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:20.41,Main,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,Arms are just decorations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.93,0:17:22.80,Main,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,The act of applause
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:26.76,Main,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,is an acclamation of the soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:32.16,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't switched places?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:34.03,Main,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,It's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.52,0:17:39.04,Main,Todo,0000,0000,0000,,My Boogie Woogie is already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.79,0:17:52.36,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Black Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.67,0:18:25.02,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:26.78,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.22,0:18:35.09,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,My stock of transfigured humans is also out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.09,0:18:37.60,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'll accept it, Mahito.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:41.28,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,I am you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:44.90,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to reject you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.72,0:18:48.52,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to pretend I didn't \Nunderstand what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.61,0:18:52.04,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,But that's different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.87,0:18:54.60,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'll just kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:59.11,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,And if you're ever reborn again as \Na new curse, I'll kill you then, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.47,0:19:01.72,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,You can change your name \Nand change your appearance,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:03.36,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,but I'll still kill you again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.95,0:19:06.13,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't need meaning or \Na reason for it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.87,0:19:09.49,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe there will be \Nsome meaning to be found
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:13.62,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,from my actions several \Ncenturies after I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.49,0:19:20.14,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm sure I'm just... \None big cog in the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.09,0:19:24.07,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,And I'll keep on killing curses \Nuntil I rust away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:29.64,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Because that is my role in this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.82,0:21:48.48,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Geto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:52.00,Main,Geto,0000,0000,0000,,Shall I save you, Mahito?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.99,0:21:54.99,Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,Episode 45\N{\fs30\fscy150}Metamorphosis
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.22,0:23:28.53,Main,Geto,0000,0000,0000,,A contrived fate may not be true destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.53,0:23:34.76,Main,Geto,0000,0000,0000,,But the moment such fake destinies \Nintertwine will nonetheless be true destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.76,0:23:36.92,Main,Geto,0000,0000,0000,,Next time, "Metamorphosis, Part 2."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.76,0:23:41.43,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\blur4}Next Episode\N{\fs30\fscy150}Metamorphosis, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.92,0:23:39.64,Main,Geto,0000,0000,0000,,Some things can only be cultivated under pretenses.